🔒 Security

* Never share your bot token publicly.
* Store credentials in environment variables.
* If your token is exposed, revoke it through BotFather and generate a new one.

⚠️ Important Notes

* An internet connection is required for communication with Telegram.
* The bot must be running for polling-based message handling to work.
* You can deploy the bot to a server for continuous operation.

